---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contribute to the GitHub Apps Directory"
  description="Suggest a GitHub App or report outdated permissions, pricing, privacy, or documentation in the Must-Have GitHub Apps directory."
>
  <section class="container page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow mono">Keep the map useful</p><h1 class="display">
      Recommend evidence, not hype.
    </h1><p>
      The directory stays current through focused contributions with official sources and clear
      limitations.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="container detail-content">
    <h2>Suggest an entry</h2><p>
      <a
        class="button"
        href="https://github.com/jordan-thirkle/must-have-github-apps/issues/new?template=app-recommendation.yml"
        >Open recommendation form</a
      >
    </p><p>
      Include the product type, installation model, problem solved, permissions, data access, setup,
      pricing, privacy, alternatives, and official documentation.
    </p>
    <h2>Correct an entry</h2><p>
      <a
        class="button secondary"
        href="https://github.com/jordan-thirkle/must-have-github-apps/issues/new?template=directory-maintenance.yml"
        >Report outdated information</a
      >
    </p><p>
      Point to the exact field, explain what changed, and include a dated official source whenever
      possible.
    </p>
    <h2>Review standard</h2><p>
      We prefer a smaller directory with traceable facts over a giant list of unverified claims.
      Read <a
        href="https://github.com/jordan-thirkle/must-have-github-apps/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md"
        >the contribution guide</a
      > before submitting.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
